# GD-1 (round 19): no `R.x` names. L §2.5: "An imported model's items are read as a.item"; gains is no member, so
# gains.rate in a rule is an unknown id (L §8.3 LOAD-NAME `unknown id <x>`; snap14 said LOAD-FIELD, reading gains as
# a key literal).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input rate: num
def owed: num at reader
  rule base = gains.rate

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 2

ask q: owed law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME unknown id gains.rate (m.tally:12)
